<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Dusty Alleys</title>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=VT323&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        body {
            background-color: #8B4513;
            color: #FFFF00;
            font-family: 'VT323', monospace !important;
        }

        h1,
        h2,
        h3 {
            font-family: 'VT323', monospace !important;
            color: #000000;
        }

        .container {
            width: 80%;
            margin: auto;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .button {
            color: black;
            cursor: pointer;
        }

        .button:hover {
            cursor: pointer;
            color: blue;
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>
    <div class="container">
        <h1>Welcome to Dusty Alleys</h1>
        <h2>A game of mystery and intrigue</h2>
        <p>
            In the dusty, forgotten corners of the underground maze leading to the vault, a guardian stands watch. He is
            the keeper of a secret, a hidden
            key that holds the power to unlock the mysteries of the past. Your task is to guide the guardian to the
            location of the key, but beware, the guardian is not easily fooled.
        </p>
        <p>
            Use your wit and cunning to decipher the clues and lead the guardian to the key. But choose your words
            carefully, for the guardian will not suffer fools lightly.
        </p>
        <a href="/guardian" class="button">Start the Game</a>
    </div>
</body>

</html>